  "body": "Auction: on site on Saturday 12 December 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nLocation, Lifestyle & Education – All in One!\r\n\r\nPositioned in the highly sought-after Rangitoto College zone, this beautiful coastal home also enjoys zoning for Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Browns Bay School. With Rangitoto College within walking distance, excellent schooling and a fantastic coastal lifestyle come together in one exceptional location.\r\n\r\nImagine waking up to stunning sea views, soaking up sunshine throughout the day, and enjoying the relaxed coastal lifestyle that makes Browns Bay so special!\r\n\r\nLovingly cared for by the same owner for over 25 years, this beautifully maintained and recently refreshed home offers the perfect combination of space, comfort, sunshine and exciting future potential.\r\n\r\nBoasting approximately 120m² of well-designed living space, this delightful home features three generous bedrooms and two bathrooms, with a thoughtfully planned layout that provides excellent separation between the living and sleeping areas — ideal for family comfort, privacy and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nStep outside onto the spacious wrap-around deck and take in those breathtaking sea views. Whether it’s your morning coffee, a weekend BBQ with friends, or simply unwinding with a glass of wine while enjoying the coastal breeze, this is Kiwi coastal living at its best!\r\n\r\nWhat Makes This Home Special:\r\n\r\n• Premium School Zones – Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Browns Bay School, with the convenience of walking to RANGI.\r\n• Amazing Sea Views – Enjoy beautiful coastal outlooks from your own wrap-around deck.\r\n• All-Day Sunshine – A wonderfully sunny home filled with natural light.\r\n• Generous Space & Smart Layout – Three bedrooms, two bathrooms and approximately 120m² of comfortable living.\r\n• Lovingly Maintained & Recently Refreshed – Proudly cared for by the same owner for over 25 years, now featuring a freshly painted roof and exterior, along with thoughtful improvements.\r\n• Indoor-Outdoor Living – A spacious wrap-around deck perfect for entertaining, relaxing and soaking up the views.\r\n• Coastal Convenience – Easy access to Browns Bay Beach, local shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities.\r\n• Exciting Future Potential – Comfortable to enjoy today, with opportunities to add your own touches and value over time.\r\n\r\nYour Coastal Lifestyle Awaits!\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in one of the North Shore’s most desirable coastal communities, this home offers the lifestyle so many families dream of.\r\n\r\nFrom morning beach walks and weekend brunches to excellent schooling and everyday convenience, everything you love about Browns Bay is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a growing family, a professional couple, a downsizer or a savvy buyer looking for a home with potential, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\n25+ Years of Love. A Lifetime of Sea Views. Your Next Chapter Starts Here!\r\n\r\nCome and experience the sunshine, views and coastal charm for yourself.\r\n\r\nCall us today or visit our open homes – we’d love to show you around!",
